(1) Individuals wishing to circulate a referendum petition shall file a referendum application  with the lieutenant governor before 5 p.m. within five calendar days after the day  on which the legislative session at which the law passed ends.

(2) The referendum application shall include:

(a) the name and residence address of at least five sponsors of the referendum petition;

